 R←Test_ListIssues_011(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;stop;filename1;filename2;filename3;filename4;filename5;html2;html3;html4;html5
⍝ Exercise ]GitHub.ListIssues with -html and -assignees=
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 stop←0
 (rc msg filename2)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -html -assignees=aplteam'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 html2←⊃⎕NGET filename2 1
 →T.PassesIf'aplteam,max-spencer' 'aplteam'≡{{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'<'}{⍵↓⍨⍵⍳'>'}⍵}¨html2[(1+⍸(∨/¨'>Assignees<'∘⍷¨html2))]

 (rc msg filename3)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -html -assignees=max-spencer'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 html3←⊃⎕NGET filename3 1
 →T.PassesIf∨/¨'max-spencer'∘⍷¨{{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'<'}{⍵↓⍨⍵⍳'>'}⍵}¨html3[(1+⍸(∨/¨'>Assignees<'∘⍷¨html3))]

 (rc msg filename4)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -html -assignees=aplteam,max-spencer'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 html4←⊃⎕NGET filename4 1
 →T.PassesIf'aplteam,max-spencer' 'aplteam'≡{{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'<'}{⍵↓⍨⍵⍳'>'}⍵}¨html4[(1+⍸(∨/¨'>Assignees<'∘⍷¨html4))]

 (rc msg filename5)←stop UCMD'ListIssues ''aplteam'' ''TestRepo'' -html -assignees=max-spencer∨aplteam'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 html5←⊃⎕NGET filename5 1
  →T.PassesIf'aplteam,max-spencer' 'aplteam'≡{{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'<'}{⍵↓⍨⍵⍳'>'}⍵}¨html5[(1+⍸(∨/¨'>Assignees<'∘⍷¨html5))]

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
